    <ele>708.4083217436333</ele>
    <time>2018-10-25T14:47:28.000Z</time>
    <name>Entlebucher_Brewery</name>
    <cmt>Back in 2008 some Guys from Entlebuch decided to start up a microbrewery in the UNESCO Biosphere Reserve called Entlebuch. Nowadays their Beer is being sold in over 200 bars, restaurants and shops. Worth a try… cheers!</cmt>
    <desc>Back in 2008 some Guys from Entlebuch decided to start up a microbrewery in the UNESCO Biosphere Reserve called Entlebuch. Nowadays their Beer is being sold in over 200 bars, restaurants and shops. Worth a try… cheers!</desc>
